ub.com/users/YourSigh","html_url":"https://github.com/YourSigh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YourSigh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YourSigh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YourSigh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YourSigh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YourSigh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YourSigh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YourSigh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YourSigh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YourSigh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T03:20:06Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T03:20:49Z","body":"![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/49e1c1e5-2ed6-4c99-8b48-84a31b139710)\n去应用程序里面右键显示包内容，然后去找\\resources\\app\\extensions\\theme-defaults\\themes\n这个路径下的文件，把vscode这个路径下的文件全部复制到Trae里面，然后重启Trae，vscode的主题颜色就过来了\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7762920f-a277-4454-ad8d-b2e846591707)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/2696075344/reactions","total_count":16,"+1":16,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/2700035974","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/97#issuecomment-2700035974","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/97","id":2700035974,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc6g70eG","user":{"login":"huangj17","id":11954057,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTU0MDU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11954057?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/huangj17","html_url":"https://github.com/huangj17","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huangj17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huangj17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huangj17/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huangj17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huangj17/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huangj17/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huangj17/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huangj17/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huangj17/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T06:56:40Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T07:10:52Z","body":"手动修改为one dark pro主题：\n1、应用程序里面右键显示包内容，找到\\resources\\app\\extensions\\theme-defaults\\themes\\dark_vs.json\n2、去找到one dark pro的git仓库，找对应的主题配置文件，https://github.com/Binaryify/OneDark-Pro/blob/master/themes/OneDark-Pro-darker.json\n3、找到OneDark-Pro-darker.json文件里面的tokenColors，复制tokenColors的所有内容\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/08f59129-a8c2-4585-a343-6aca03d63f36)\n\n粘贴到Trae的dark_vs.json里面对应的tokenColors，覆盖所有\n\n<img width=\"453\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f877b5e3-4334-4495-9276-8534122064ad\" />\n\n4、同理再去one仓库的配置文件中复制colors，再贴入dark_vs.json里面对应的colors，覆盖所有\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c25bb6ce-15c5-4034-a4e4-9553e0ca99cb)\n<img width=\"360\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c48c34a7-0a85-42fb-b5d7-75fc30291434\" />\n\n5、删除themes\\dark_plus.json里面的tokenColors和colors，只留其他的（避免覆盖dark_vs.json中的设置）\n\n<img width=\"455\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3cb88ec1-fddb-4342-a23f-d29ad5d3ed63\" />\n\n6、重启Trae完成～\n\n<img width=\"1512\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ac10382b-8c28-4816-8277-fda47d54fc88\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com